{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEMN2FTuQ88FGSTWJXi2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both symptoms had one cause: `hidden` is a DynamoDB reserved word, and `src/app.py` used it as a bare attribute name. The fix is in place, the tests pass, and the causes are written up in `ANSWER.md`. I haven't committed anything.\n\n- **Prod 500 on hide:** `hide()` wrote `SET hidden = :h, ...`. DynamoDB rejects a bare reserved word in an update, so the request failed and the story was never hidden.\n- **Staging feed:** `feed()` projected `hidden` bare. DynamoDB drops a bare reserved word from a projection without an error, so the filter never saw the flag. The hand-hide with `#h` did write the flag correctly, which is why the feed looked cached. It isn't cached. It just never read the flag.\n\n**Fix**\n- Every attribute name in every expression in `src/app.py` now goes through `ExpressionAttributeNames`. This covers `publish`, `rename`, `hide`, `feed` and `archive`. `archive` had the same bug with `status`, though it isn't wired to the API yet.\n- Three regression tests cover hide, the hand-hidden case and archive. A fourth test parses `src/app.py` and fails if any expression uses a bare name. I added it because the fake DynamoDB only knows a subset of the reserved words.\n- `python3 -m unittest discover tests` now runs 9 tests, all passing. Against the original code, the three behavioural tests fail.\n\n**Staging data:** no migration is needed. The hand-hidden `my-first-week` already has `hidden: true`, so it leaves the feed once the fix is deployed.\n\n**Not changed:** `feed()` reads only the first scan page, so it will silently miss stories once the table outgrows one 1 MB page. Separately, `api.py` is in the infra repo, which I don't have, so I couldn't check how it handles a missing slug.\n\nI didn't deploy or report anything externally. The fix is uncommitted in the working tree."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":524,"cache_read_input_tokens":45349,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":524},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"50e533c2-7a37-477b-ae04-6be871ff3d2a","uuid":"5ce88ee8-0ead-42a1-b237-bcfc48532e55","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:24:42.174Z","request_id":"req_011CgEMN1w7bu7T4imFSpy3B"}
